---
---

<section id="zonas" class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Trabajamos en Toda España</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Cobertura nacional con equipos especializados en cada zona
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zones-grid">
      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Madrid</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">Madrid capital y Comunidad de Madrid</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Barcelona</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">Barcelona y área metropolitana</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Valencia</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">Valencia y Comunidad Valenciana</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Sevilla</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">Sevilla y toda Andalucía</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Bilbao</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">País Vasco y zonas limítrofes</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Zaragoza</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">Aragón y zonas del interior</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Málaga</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">Costa del Sol y provincia</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Murcia</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">Región de Murcia</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Palma</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">Islas Baleares</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Las Palmas</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">Islas Canarias</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Galicia</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">A Coruña, Vigo, Santiago</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-card">
        <h3 class="zone-title">Castilla y León</h3>
        <p class="zone-description">Valladolid, Salamanca, León</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="coverage-notice">
      <p>
        <strong>¿Tu zona no aparece en la lista?</strong> Consultamos. Tenemos cobertura en toda España incluyendo zonas rurales y polígonos industriales.
      </p>
      <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-outline">Consultar Cobertura</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .zones-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .zone-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .zone-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2);
  }

  .zone-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .zone-description {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .coverage-notice {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 2px dashed var(--color-border);
  }

  .coverage-notice p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .zones-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .zones-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .zone-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .coverage-notice {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .coverage-notice p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
